{"segs": ["PA_ja_154:0.1", "PA_ja_154:0.2", "PA_ja_154:0.3"], "en": "Jātaka: The Second Book of Birth Stories (Dukanipāta), Chapter on the Firm (Daḷhavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_154:0.4"], "en": "4. The Uragajāta­ka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_154:1.1", "PA_ja_154:1.2"], "en": "“Here has entered the most excellent of serpents, desiring release by means of the color of the rock;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_154:1.3"], "en": "\"Honoring the praise of Brahmā,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_154:1.4"], "en": "though famished, I cannot bring myself to eat.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_154:2.1"], "en": "\"Protected by Brahmā, may you live for a long time!\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_154:2.2"], "en": "And may divine foods appear for you; for you,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_154:2.3"], "en": "though honoring one who has the form of a Brahmā,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_154:2.4"], "en": "do not abandon eating because you are hungry.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_154:3.1"], "en": "The Uragajātaka, the fourth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
